#. Description of the 'Book Deferred entries based on' (Select) field in
#. DocType 'Accounts Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json
msgid "If \"Months\" is selected, a fixed amount will be booked as deferred revenue or expense for each month irrespective of the number of days in a month. It will be prorated if deferred revenue or expense is not booked for an entire month"
msgstr "Če je izbrano \"Meseci\", bo fiksni znesek za vsak mesec rezerviran kot odloženi prihodki ali stroški ne glede na število dni v mesecu. Če odloženi prihodki ali stroški ne bodo rezervirani za cel mesec, bo znesek sorazmerno razdeljen"

#. Description of the 'Reconcile on Advance Payment Date' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Company'
#: erpnext/setup/doctype/company/company.json
msgid "If <b>Enabled</b> - Reconciliation happens on the <b>Advance Payment posting date</b><br>\n"
"If <b>Disabled</b> - Reconciliation happens on oldest of 2 Dates: <b>Invoice Date</b> or the <b>Advance Payment posting date</b><br>\n"
msgstr "Če je <b>Omogočeno</b> - Usklajevanje poteka na <b>datumu knjiženja predplačila</b><br>\n"
"Če je <b>Onemogočeno</b> - Usklajevanje poteka na starejšem od 2 datumov: <b>Datum računa</b> ali <b>datum knjiženja predplačila</b><br>\n"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/loyalty_program/loyalty_program.js:34
msgid "If Auto Opt In is checked, then the customers will be automatically linked with the concerned Loyalty Program (on save)"
msgstr "Če je označena možnost Samodejna prijava, bodo stranke samodejno povezane z zadevnim programom zvestobe (ob shranjevanju)."

#. Description of the 'Cost Center' (Link) field in DocType 'Journal Entry
#. Account'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/journal_entry_account/journal_entry_account.json
msgid "If Income or Expense"
msgstr "Če prihodek ali odhodek"

#: banking/src/components/features/Settings/Preferences.tsx:127
msgid "If a party cannot be matched by account number or IBAN, the system will try fuzzy matching using the party name and transaction description."
msgstr "Če partnerja ni mogoče ujemati po številki računa ali IBAN, bo sistem poskušal neostro ujemanje po nazivu partnerja in opisu transakcije."

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/operation/operation.js:32
msgid "If an operation is divided into sub operations, they can be added here."
msgstr "Če je operacija razdeljena na podoperacije, jih je mogoče dodati tukaj."

#. Description of the 'Account' (Link) field in DocType 'Warehouse'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/warehouse/warehouse.json
msgid "If blank, parent Warehouse Account or company default will be considered in transactions"
msgstr "Če je prazno, se pri transakcijah upošteva račun nadrejenega skladišča ali privzeti račun podjetja"

#. Description of the 'Bill for rejected quantity in Purchase Invoice' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Buying Settings'
#: erpnext/buying/doctype/buying_settings/buying_settings.json
msgid "If checked, Rejected Quantity will be included while making Purchase Invoice from Purchase Receipt."
msgstr ""

#. Description of the 'Reserve Stock' (Check) field in DocType 'Sales Order'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/sales_order/sales_order.json
msgid "If checked, Stock will be reserved on <b>Submit</b>"
msgstr "Če je označeno, bo Zaloga rezervirana ob <b>Oddaj</b>."

#. Description of the 'Is Credit Card' (Check) field in DocType 'Bank Account'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/bank_account/bank_account.json
msgid "If checked, journal entries made using bank reconciliation will be of type \"Credit Card Entry\""
msgstr "Če je potrjeno, bodo vnosi v dnevnik, ustvarjeni z bančno uskladitvijo, vrste »Vnos kreditne kartice«."

#. Description of the 'Scan Mode' (Check) field in DocType 'Pick List'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/pick_list/pick_list.json
msgid "If checked, picked qty won't automatically be fulfilled on submit of pick list."
msgstr "Če je označeno, komisionirana količina ob oddaji seznama za komisioniranje ne bo samodejno izpolnjena."

#. Description of the 'Allocate Full Amount to Stock Items' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Purchase Taxes and Charges'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/purchase_taxes_and_charges/purchase_taxes_and_charges.json
msgid "If checked, the entire amount (e.g. Freight) is allocated to the valuation of stock & asset items only. If unchecked, the amount is distributed across all items and the portion belonging to non-stock items is not added to valuation."
msgstr "Če je označeno, se celoten znesek (npr. Prevoznina) dodeli samo vrednotenju zalogovnih in sredstvenih artiklov. Če ni označeno, se znesek porazdeli med vse artikle, delež, ki pripada nezalogovnim artiklom, pa se ne prišteje k vrednotenju."

#. Description of the 'Considered In Paid Amount' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Purchase Taxes and Charges'
#. Description of the 'Considered In Paid Amount' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Sales Taxes and Charges'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/purchase_taxes_and_charges/purchase_taxes_and_charges.json
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/sales_taxes_and_charges/sales_taxes_and_charges.json
msgid "If checked, the tax amount will be considered as already included in the Paid Amount in Payment Entry"
msgstr "Če je potrditveno polje označeno, bo znesek davka obravnavan kot že vključen v Plačani znesek v Vnosu plačila"

#. Description of the 'Is this Tax included in Basic Rate?' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Purchase Taxes and Charges'
#. Description of the 'Is this Tax included in Basic Rate?' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Sales Taxes and Charges'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/purchase_taxes_and_charges/purchase_taxes_and_charges.json
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/sales_taxes_and_charges/sales_taxes_and_charges.json
msgid "If checked, the tax amount will be considered as already included in the Print Rate / Print Amount"
msgstr "Če je označeno, se bo znesek davka štel kot že vključen v ceno tiskanja / znesek tiskanja"

#. Description of the 'Update Stock' (Check) field in DocType 'Sales Invoice'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/sales_invoice/sales_invoice.json
msgid "If checked, updates inventory; stock and accounting entries are created together. Leave unchecked if a Delivery Note is created separately."
msgstr "Če je potrjeno, se posodobi zaloga; vnosi zalog in knjižbe se ustvarijo skupaj. Pustite nepotrjeno, če se dobavnica ustvari ločeno."

#. Description of the 'Update Stock' (Check) field in DocType 'Purchase
#. Invoice'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/purchase_invoice/purchase_invoice.json
msgid "If checked, updates inventory; stock and accounting entries are created together. Leave unchecked if a Purchase Receipt is created separately."
msgstr "Če je potrjeno, se posodobi zaloga; vnosi zalog in knjižbe se ustvarijo skupaj. Pustite nepotrjeno, če se prevzemnica ustvari ločeno."

#. Description of the 'Service Address' (Small Text) field in DocType 'Warranty
#. Claim'
#: erpnext/support/doctype/warranty_claim/warranty_claim.json
msgid "If different than customer address"
msgstr "Če se razlikuje od naslova stranke"

#. Description of the 'Disable In Words' (Check) field in DocType 'Global
#. Defaults'
#: erpnext/setup/doctype/global_defaults/global_defaults.json
msgid "If disable, 'In Words' field will not be visible in any transaction"
msgstr "Če je onemogočeno, polje 'Z besedo' ne bo vidno v nobeni transakciji."

#. Description of the 'Disable Rounded Total' (Check) field in DocType 'Global
#. Defaults'
#: erpnext/setup/doctype/global_defaults/global_defaults.json
msgid "If disable, 'Rounded Total' field will not be visible in any transaction"
msgstr "Če je onemogočeno, polje 'Zaokrožen skupni znesek' ne bo vidno v nobeni transakciji"

#. Description of the 'Ignore Pricing Rule' (Check) field in DocType 'Pick
#. List'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/pick_list/pick_list.json
msgid "If enabled then system won't apply the pricing rule on the delivery note which will be create from the pick list"
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, sistem ne bo uporabil pravila za oblikovanje cen na dobavnici, ki bo ustvarjena iz seznama za komisioniranje."

#. Description of the 'Pick Manually' (Check) field in DocType 'Pick List'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/pick_list/pick_list.json
msgid "If enabled then system won't override the picked qty / batches / serial numbers / warehouse."
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, sistem ne bo prepisal komisionirane količine / serij / serijskih številk / skladišča."

#. Description of the 'Send Document Print' (Check) field in DocType 'Request
#. for Quotation'
#: erpnext/buying/doctype/request_for_quotation/request_for_quotation.json
msgid "If enabled, a print of this document will be attached to each email"
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bo vsakemu e-poštnemu sporočilu priložen izpis tega dokumenta."

#. Description of the 'Auto Repost Incorrect Valuation Entries (Weekly)'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Stock Reposting Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_reposting_settings/stock_reposting_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, a weekly scheduler scans the Stock Ledger Variance for item-warehouses with incorrect valuation in the current financial year and auto-creates Item & Warehouse based reposts to fix them."
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, tedenski razporejevalnik preveri Odstopanje knjige zalog za kombinacije artikel-skladišče z napačnim vrednotenjem v tekočem poslovnem letu in samodejno ustvari ponovna knjiženja na podlagi Artikla in Skladišča za njihov popravek."

#. Description of the 'Enable discount accounting for selling' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Selling Settings'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/selling_settings/selling_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, additional ledger entries will be made for discounts in a separate Discount Account"
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bodo za popuste ustvarjene dodatne knjižbe na ločenem računu za popuste."

#. Description of the 'Send Attached Files' (Check) field in DocType 'Request
#. for Quotation'
#: erpnext/buying/doctype/request_for_quotation/request_for_quotation.json
msgid "If enabled, all files attached to this document will be attached to each email"
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bodo vse datoteke, priložene temu dokumentu, priložene vsakemu e-poštnemu sporočilu"

#. Description of the 'Do not update Serial / Batch on creation of auto bundle'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, do not update serial / batch values in the stock transactions on creation of auto Serial \n"
" / Batch Bundle. "
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, ne posodabljajte vrednosti serijske številke / šarže v skladiščnih transakcijah pri samodejnem ustvarjanju Serijsko \\n / Paket šarž. "

#. Description of the 'Consider Projected Qty in Calculation' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Production Plan'
#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/production_plan/production_plan.json
msgid "If enabled, formula for <b>Qty to Order</b>: <br>\n"
"Required Qty (BOM) - <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/projected-quantity\">Projected Qty</a>. <br> This helps avoid over-ordering."
msgstr ""

#. Description of the 'Consider Projected Qty in Calculation (RM)' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Production Plan'
#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/production_plan/production_plan.json
msgid "If enabled, formula for <b>Required Qty</b>: <br>\n"
"Required Qty (BOM) - <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/projected-quantity\">Projected Qty</a>. <br> This helps avoid over-ordering."
msgstr ""

#. Description of the 'Create Ledger Entries for Change Amount' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'POS Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pos_settings/pos_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, ledger entries will be posted for change amount in POS transactions"
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bodo za vračilo v transakcijah POS knjižene knjižbe."

#. Description of the 'Automatically run rules on unreconciled transactions'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Accounts Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, rule matching algorithm will run every hour"
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bo algoritem za ujemanje pravil deloval vsako uro."

#. Description of the 'Grant Commission' (Check) field in DocType 'Item'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/item/item.json
msgid "If enabled, sales from this item will be included in Sales Person and Sales Partner commission calculations"
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bodo prodaje tega artikla vključene v izračun provizij za prodajalca in prodajnega partnerja"

#. Description of the 'Allow delivery of overproduced quantity' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'Selling Settings'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/selling_settings/selling_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, system will allow user to deliver the entire quantity of the finished goods produced against the Subcontracting Inward Order. If disabled, system will allow delivery of only the ordered quantity."
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bo sistem uporabniku dovolil dostaviti celotno količino končnih izdelkov, proizvedenih proti Vhodnemu naročilu podizvajanja. Če je onemogočeno, bo sistem dovolil dostavo samo naročene količine."

#. Description of the 'Set incoming rate as zero for expired Batch' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Selling Settings'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/selling_settings/selling_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, system will set incoming rate as zero for stand-alone credit notes with expired batch item."
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bo sistem vhodno ceno nastavil na nič za samostojne dobropise z artiklom s šaržo, ki je potekel."

#. Description of the 'Deliver secondary Items' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Selling Settings'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/selling_settings/selling_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, the Secondary Items generated against a Finished Good will also be added in the Stock Entry when delivering that Finished Good."
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bodo sekundarni artikli, ustvarjeni proti končnemu izdelku, dodani tudi v vnos zaloge ob dobavi tega končnega izdelka."

#. Description of the 'Disable Rounded Total' (Check) field in DocType 'POS
#. Profile'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pos_profile/pos_profile.json
msgid "If enabled, the consolidated invoices will have rounded total disabled"
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bo pri konsolidiranih računih onemogočen zaokrožen skupni znesek"

#. Description of the 'Allow internal transfers at user-defined rate' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, the item rate won't adjust to the valuation rate during internal transfers, but accounting will still use the valuation rate. This will allow the user to specify a different rate for printing or taxation purposes."
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, se cena artikla med internimi prenosi ne bo prilagodila cenilni stopnji, vendar bo računovodstvo še vedno uporabljalo cenilno stopnjo. To bo uporabniku omogočilo, da za tiskanje ali davčne namene določi drugačno ceno."

#. Description of the 'Validate Material Transfer warehouses' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, the source and target warehouse in the Material Transfer Stock Entry must be different else an error will be thrown. If inventory dimensions are present, same source and target warehouse can be allowed but atleast any one of the inventory dimension fields must be different."
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, morata biti izvorno in ciljno skladišče v Vnosu zaloge za prenos materiala različna, sicer se bo prikazala napaka. Če so prisotne dimenzije zaloge, je lahko enako izvorno in ciljno skladišče dovoljeno, vendar mora biti vsaj eno od polj dimenzije zaloge drugačno."

#. Description of the 'Allow negative stock for Batch' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, the system will allow negative stock entries for the batch. But, this may lead to incorrect valuation rates, so it is recommended to avoid using this option. The system will permit negative stock only when it is caused by backdated entries and will validate and block negative stock in all other cases."
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bo sistem dovolil negativne vnose zaloge za šaržo. Vendar lahko to privede do napačnih stopenj vrednotenja, zato je priporočljivo, da se tej možnosti izogibate. Sistem bo dovolil negativno zalogo le, kadar je ta posledica vnosov za nazaj, v vseh drugih primerih pa bo negativno zalogo preveril in blokiral."

#. Description of the 'Allow Negative Stock for Batch' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Batch'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/batch/batch.json
msgid "If enabled, the system will allow negative stock entries for this batch, overriding the 'Allow negative stock for Batch' setting in Stock Settings. This may lead to incorrect valuation rates, so it is recommended to avoid using this option."
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bo sistem za to šaržo dovolil negativne vnose zalog in preglasil nastavitev »Dovoli negativno zalogo za šarže« v nastavitvah zaloge. To lahko povzroči napačne stopnje vrednotenja, zato je priporočljivo, da se te možnosti ne uporablja."

#. Description of the 'Allow UOM with conversion rate defined in Item' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, the system will allow selecting UOMs in sales and purchase transactions only if the conversion rate is set in the item master."
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bo sistem pri prodajnih in nabavnih transakcijah dovolil izbiro enot mere le, če je v šifrantu artiklov nastavljena stopnja pretvorbe."

#. Description of the 'Allow Editing of Items and Quantities in Work Order'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Manufacturing Settings'
#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/manufacturing_settings/manufacturing_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, the system will allow users to edit the raw materials and their quantities in the Work Order. The system will not reset the quantities as per the BOM, if the user has changed them."
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bo sistem uporabnikom dovolil urejanje surovin in njihovih količin v delovnem nalogu. Sistem količin ne bo ponastavil v skladu s kosovnico, če jih je uporabnik spremenil."

#. Description of the 'Set valuation rate for rejected Materials' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'Buying Settings'
#: erpnext/buying/doctype/buying_settings/buying_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, the system will generate an accounting entry for materials rejected in the Purchase Receipt."
msgstr ""

#. Description of the 'Enable Item-wise Inventory Account' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Company'
#: erpnext/setup/doctype/company/company.json
msgid "If enabled, the system will use the inventory account set in the Item Master or Item Group or Brand. Otherwise, it will use the inventory account set in the Warehouse."
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bo sistem uporabil konto zalog, nastavljen v Šifrantu artiklov, Skupini artiklov ali Znamki. Sicer bo uporabil konto zalog, nastavljen v Skladišču."

#. Description of the 'Do not use Batch-wise Valuation' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, the system will use the moving average valuation method to calculate the valuation rate for the batched items and will not consider the individual batch-wise incoming rate."
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bo sistem za izračun stopnje vrednotenja artiklov po šaržah uporabil metodo drseče povprečje in ne bo upošteval posamezne vhodne cene po šaržah."

#. Description of the 'Validate Applied Rule' (Check) field in DocType 'Pricing
#. Rule'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/pricing_rule.json
msgid "If enabled, then system will only validate the pricing rule and not apply automatically. User has to manually set the discount percentage / margin / free items to validate the pricing rule"
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bo sistem le preveril pravilo za oblikovanje cen in ga ne bo samodejno uporabil. Uporabnik mora ročno nastaviti odstotek popusta / maržo / brezplačne artikle, da preveri pravilo za oblikovanje cen"

#. Description of the 'Include in Charts' (Check) field in DocType 'Financial
#. Report Row'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/financial_report_row/financial_report_row.json
msgid "If enabled, this row's values will be displayed on financial charts"
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bodo vrednosti te vrstice prikazane na finančnih grafikonih"

#. Description of the 'Confirm before resetting posting date' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Accounts Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, user will be alerted before resetting posting date to current date in relevant transactions"
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bo uporabnik opozorjen, preden se datum knjiženja ponastavi na trenutni datum v ustreznih transakcijah"

#. Description of the 'Disable Serial No and Batch selector' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, users must enter Serial No. / Batch data manually instead of using the selector dialog."
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, morajo uporabniki podatke o serijski številki / šarži vnašati ročno namesto uporabe pogovornega okna za izbiro."

#. Description of the 'Variant Of' (Link) field in DocType 'Item'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/item/item.json
msgid "If item is a variant of another item then description, image, pricing, taxes etc will be set from the template unless explicitly specified"
msgstr "Če je artikel različica drugega artikla, bodo opis, slika, oblikovanje cen, davki itd. nastavljeni iz predloge, razen če je izrecno določeno drugače"

#. Description of the 'Get Items for Purchase / Transfer' (Button) field in
#. DocType 'Production Plan'
#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/production_plan/production_plan.json
msgid "If items in stock, proceed with Material Transfer or Purchase."
msgstr "Če so artikli na zalogi, nadaljujte s prenosom materiala ali nabavo."

#. Description of the 'Role allowed to create/edit back-dated transactions'
#. (Link) field in DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json
msgid "If mentioned, the system will allow only the users with this Role to create or modify any stock transaction earlier than the latest stock transaction for a specific item and warehouse. If set as blank, it allows all users to create/edit back-dated transactions."
msgstr "Če je navedeno, bo sistem dovolil ustvarjanje ali urejanje katerekoli transakcije zalog, starejše od zadnje transakcije zalog za določen artikel in skladišče, samo uporabnikom s to vlogo. Če je polje prazno, vsem uporabnikom dovoli ustvarjanje/urejanje transakcij z nazajnjim datumom."

#. Description of the 'To Package No.' (Int) field in DocType 'Packing Slip'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/packing_slip/packing_slip.json
msgid "If more than one package of the same type (for print)"
msgstr "Če je več kot en paket iste vrste (za tisk)"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/pricing_rule.js:103
msgid "If multiple Pricing Rules continue to prevail, users are asked to set Priority manually to resolve conflict."
msgstr "Če več Pravil za oblikovanje cen še naprej velja, uporabnike prosimo, naj ročno nastavijo Prioriteto, da se konflikt reši."

#. Description of the 'Use prices from Default Price List as fallback' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Selling Settings'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/selling_settings/selling_settings.json
msgid "If no Item Price is found for an item in the Price List set in the transaction, prices from the Default Price List will be fetched."
msgstr "Če za artikel v cenovniku, nastavljenem v transakciji, ni najdena Cena artikla, bodo cene pridobljene iz Privzetega cenika."

#. Description of the 'Automatically add taxes from Taxes and Charges Template'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Accounts Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json
msgid "If no taxes are set, and Taxes and Charges Template is selected, the system will automatically apply the taxes from the chosen template."
msgstr "Če davki niso nastavljeni in je izbrana Predloga davkov in stroškov, bo sistem samodejno uporabil davke iz izbrane predloge."

#: erpnext/stock/stock_ledger.py:2390
msgid "If not, you can Cancel / Submit this entry"
msgstr "Če ne, lahko ta vnos prekličete / oddate"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/opening_invoice_creation_tool/opening_invoice_creation_tool.js:201
msgid "If party does not exist, create it using the Customer Name field."
msgstr "Če stranka ne obstaja, jo ustvarite z uporabo polja Ime stranke."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/opening_invoice_creation_tool/opening_invoice_creation_tool.js:202
msgid "If party does not exist, create it using the Supplier Name field."
msgstr "Če stranka ne obstaja, jo ustvarite s poljem Ime dobavitelja."

#. Description of the 'Free Item Rate' (Currency) field in DocType 'Pricing
#. Rule'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/pricing_rule.json
msgid "If rate is zero then item will be treated as \"Free Item\""
msgstr "Če je cena nič, bo artikel obravnavan kot »Brezplačni artikel«."

#: banking/src/components/features/BankReconciliation/Rules/RuleForm.tsx:259
msgid "If rule matches, then:"
msgstr "Če se pravilo ujema, potem:"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/pricing_rule.js:51
msgid "If selected Pricing Rule is made for 'Rate', it will overwrite Price List. Pricing Rule rate is the final rate, so no further discount should be applied. Hence, in transactions like Sales Order, Purchase Order etc, it will be fetched in 'Rate' field, rather than 'Price List Rate' field."
msgstr "Če je izbrano pravilo za oblikovanje cen ustvarjeno za 'Ceno', bo prepisalo cenik. Cena pravila za oblikovanje cen je končna cena, zato ne sme biti uporabljen noben nadaljnji popust. Zato bo pri transakcijah, kot so Prodajno naročilo, Naročilnica itd., vneseno v polje 'Cena', ne pa v polje 'Cena iz cenika'."

#. Description of the 'Default Accounts' (Table) field in DocType 'Customer'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/customer/customer.json
msgid "If set, accounting entries for this customer will post to these accounts instead of the company default."
msgstr "Če je nastavljeno, bodo knjižbe za tega kupca knjižene na teh kontih namesto na privzetem kontu podjetja."

#. Description of the 'Fixed Outgoing Email Account' (Link) field in DocType
#. 'Buying Settings'
#: erpnext/buying/doctype/buying_settings/buying_settings.json
msgid "If set, the system does not use the user's Email or the standard outgoing Email account for sending request for quotations."
msgstr "Če je nastavljeno, sistem ne uporablja uporabnikovega e-poštnega naslova ali standardnega odhodnega e-poštnega računa za pošiljanje povpraševanj."

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/work_order/work_order.js:1332
msgid "If the BOM results in Scrap material, the Scrap Warehouse needs to be selected."
msgstr "Če kosovnica povzroči odpadni material, je treba izbrati skladišče odpadkov."

#. Description of the 'Frozen' (Select) field in DocType 'Account'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/account/account.json
msgid "If the account is frozen, entries are allowed to restricted users."
msgstr "Če je račun zamrznjen, so vnosi dovoljeni omejenim uporabnikom."

#: erpnext/stock/stock_ledger.py:2383
msgid "If the item is transacting as a Zero Valuation Rate item in this entry, please enable 'Allow Zero Valuation Rate' in the {0} Item table."
msgstr "Če se artikel v tem vnosu obravnava kot artikel z ničelno stopnjo vrednotenja, prosimo, omogočite »Dovoli ničelno stopnjo vrednotenja« v tabeli artiklov v {0}."

#. Description of the 'Projected On Hand' (Float) field in DocType 'Material
#. Request Item'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/material_request_item/material_request_item.json
msgid "If the reorder check is set at the Group warehouse level, the available quantity becomes the sum of the projected quantities of all its child warehouses."
msgstr "Če je preverjanje ponovnega naročila nastavljeno na ravni skupinskega skladišča, postane razpoložljiva količina vsota predvidenih količin vseh njegovih podrejenih skladišč."

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/work_order/work_order.js:1351
msgid "If the selected BOM has Operations mentioned in it, the system will fetch all Operations from BOM, these values can be changed."
msgstr "Če izbrana kosovnica vsebuje operacije, bo sistem pridobil vse operacije iz kosovnice; te vrednosti je mogoče spremeniti."

#. Description of the 'Catch All' (Link) field in DocType 'Communication
#. Medium'
#: erpnext/communication/doctype/communication_medium/communication_medium.json
msgid "If there is no assigned timeslot, then communication will be handled by this group"
msgstr "Če ni dodeljenega časovnega okna, bo komunikacijo obravnaval ta skupina"

#: erpnext/edi/doctype/code_list/code_list_import.js:24
msgid "If there is no title column, use the code column for the title."
msgstr "Če stolpca za naslov ni, uporabite za naslov stolpec s kodo."

#. Description of the 'Allocate Payment Based On Payment Terms' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'Payment Terms Template'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/payment_terms_template/payment_terms_template.json
msgid "If this checkbox is checked, paid amount will be splitted and allocated as per the amounts in payment schedule against each payment term"
msgstr "Če je to potrditveno polje označeno, bo plačani znesek razdeljen in dodeljen glede na zneske v plačilnem načrtu za vsak plačilni pogoj"

#. Description of the 'Follow Calendar Months' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Subscription'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/subscription/subscription.json
msgid "If this is checked subsequent new invoices will be created on calendar  month and quarter start dates irrespective of current invoice start date"
msgstr "Če je to označeno, bodo naslednji novi računi ustvarjeni na začetnih datumih koledarskega meseca in četrtletja, ne glede na začetni datum trenutnega računa"

#. Description of the 'Submit Journal entries' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Accounts Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json
msgid "If this is unchecked Journal Entries will be saved in a Draft state and will have to be submitted manually"
msgstr "Če ta možnost ni označena, bodo vnosi v dnevnik shranjeni v stanju osnutka in jih bo treba oddati ročno."

#. Description of the 'Book deferred entries via Journal Entry' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'Accounts Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json
msgid "If this is unchecked, direct GL entries will be created to book deferred revenue or expense"
msgstr "Če to ni označeno, bodo ustvarjene neposredne knjižbe glavne knjige za knjiženje odloženih prihodkov ali odhodkov"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/payment_entry/payment_entry.py:782
msgid "If this is undesirable please cancel the corresponding Payment Entry."
msgstr "Če to ni zaželeno, prosimo, prekličite ustrezen Vnos plačila."

#. Description of the 'Has Variants' (Check) field in DocType 'Item'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/item/item.json
msgid "If this item has variants, then it cannot be selected in sales orders etc."
msgstr "Če ima ta artikel različice, ga ni mogoče izbrati v prodajnih naročilih ipd."

#: erpnext/buying/doctype/buying_settings/buying_settings.js:76
msgid "If this option is configured 'Yes', ERPNext will prevent you from creating a Purchase Invoice or Receipt without creating a Purchase Order first. This configuration can be overridden for a particular supplier by enabling the 'Allow Purchase Invoice Creation Without Purchase Order' checkbox in the Supplier master."
msgstr "Če je ta možnost nastavljena na 'Da', vam ERPNext ne bo dovolil ustvariti Prejetega računa ali Prejema brez predhodnega ustvarjanja Naročilnice. To nastavitev je mogoče za določenega dobavitelja preglasiti z omogočanjem potrditvenega polja 'Dovoli ustvarjanje prejetega računa brez naročilnice' v matičnih podatkih dobavitelja."

#: erpnext/buying/doctype/buying_settings/buying_settings.js:83
msgid "If this option is configured 'Yes', ERPNext will prevent you from creating a Purchase Invoice without creating a Purchase Receipt first. This configuration can be overridden for a particular supplier by enabling the 'Allow Purchase Invoice Creation Without Purchase Receipt' checkbox in the Supplier master."
msgstr "Če je ta možnost nastavljena na 'Da', vam bo ERPNext preprečil ustvarjanje Prejetega računa brez predhodnega ustvarjanja Prevzemnice. To nastavitev je mogoče za določenega dobavitelja preglasiti z omogočitvijo potrditvenega polja 'Dovoli ustvarjanje prejetega računa brez prevzemnice' v matičnih podatkih Dobavitelja."

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/manufacturing_settings/manufacturing_settings.js:10
msgid "If ticked, multiple materials can be used for a single Work Order. This is useful if one or more time consuming products are being manufactured."
msgstr "Če je označeno, je za en delovni nalog mogoče uporabiti več materialov. To je uporabno, če izdelujete enega ali več izdelkov, katerih izdelava traja dolgo."

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/manufacturing_settings/manufacturing_settings.js:24
msgid "If ticked, the BOM cost will be automatically updated based on Valuation Rate / Price List Rate / last purchase rate of raw materials."
msgstr "Če je označeno, se bo strošek kosovnice (BOM) samodejno posodobil na podlagi stopnje vrednotenja / cene iz cenika / cene zadnjega nakupa surovin."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/pricing_rule.js:82
msgid "If two or more Pricing Rules are found based on the above conditions, Priority is applied. Priority is a number between 0 to 20 while default value is zero (blank). Higher number means it will take precedence if there are multiple Pricing Rules with same conditions."
msgstr "Če so na podlagi zgornjih pogojev najdena dve ali več pravil za oblikovanje cen, se uporabi Prioriteta. Prioriteta je število med 0 in 20, privzeta vrednost pa je nič (prazno). Višje število pomeni, da bo imelo prednost, če obstaja več pravil za oblikovanje cen z enakimi pogoji."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/loyalty_program/loyalty_program.js:31
msgid "If unlimited expiry for the Loyalty Points, keep the Expiry Duration empty or 0."
msgstr "Če točke zvestobe nimajo časovne omejitve veljavnosti, pustite polje Trajanje poteka prazno ali vpišite 0."

#. Description of the 'Is Rejected Warehouse' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Warehouse'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/warehouse/warehouse.json
msgid "If yes, then this warehouse will be used to store rejected materials"
msgstr "Če je da, bo to skladišče uporabljeno za shranjevanje zavrnjenih materialov"

#: erpnext/stock/doctype/item/item.js:1481
msgid "If you are maintaining stock of this Item in your Inventory, ERPNext will make a stock ledger entry for each transaction of this item."
msgstr "Če vodite zalogo tega Artikla v svojem skladišču, bo ERPNext za vsako transakcijo tega artikla ustvaril vnos v knjigo zalog."

#. Description of the 'Unreconciled Entries' (Section Break) field in DocType
#. 'Payment Reconciliation'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/payment_reconciliation/payment_reconciliation.json
msgid "If you need to reconcile particular transactions against each other, then please select accordingly. If not, all the transactions will be allocated in FIFO order."
msgstr "Če želite določene transakcije uskladiti med seboj, jih ustrezno izberite. Če ne, bodo vse transakcije dodeljene po vrstnem redu FIFO."

